    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of the game is very simple. You must reach the end of the game by overcoming all the obstacles. You will need a light while playing the game because there will not be enough light on the map. For this you must use your own light.\u00a0 Additionally, the game has many challenging obstacles. You must find the right solution to overcome all obstacles. However, this will not be as easy as you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's mechanics are very easy to learn: W-A-S-D / SpaceBar / Mouse / E: for lighting / Q: for running / G: quick kill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The important thing is only finishing the game. The time of finishing the game is not very important because of the game's high level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Note:\u00a0</strong> The Game was designed for <strong>only Pro Gamers</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not normal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. As game developers, we finished the game in two hours. So the game can be finished.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of the game is very simple. You must reach the end of the game by overcoming all the obstacles. You will need a light while playing the game because there will not be enough light on the map. For this you must use your own light.\u00a0 Additionally, the game has many challenging obstacles. You must find the right solution to overcome all obstacles. However, this will not be as easy as you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's mechanics are very easy to learn: W-A-S-D / SpaceBar / Mouse / E: for lighting / Q: for running / G: quick kill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The important thing is only finishing the game. The time of finishing the game is not very important because of the game's high level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Note:\u00a0</strong> The Game was designed for <strong>only Pro Gamers</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not normal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. As game developers, we finished the game in two hours. So the game can be finished.</p></li></ul>",
